{"id":"ut6x0ntjosc7clzlfzt20k9v4","title":"利用机器学习识别铅管的新工具","originalTitle":"How machine learning can tackle lead pipe challenges","summary":"一项新研究开发了一种机器学习工具，通过分析现有数据集来预测铅服务管道的存在位置，帮助水公司更有效地识别和替换铅管，降低成本并提高效率。该工具已在《水资源规划与管理》杂志上发表。该项目由谢菲尔德大学和西南水务公司合作进行，旨在解决水行业长期存在的铅管问题。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-machine-tackle-pipe.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T00:20:06.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T00:51:35.661Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T00:51:35.661Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"46de5e88-de4d-4803-b7da-565181c6e034","title":"谢菲尔德大学与西南水务合作开发铅管识别机器学习工具"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"46de5e88-de4d-4803-b7da-565181c6e034","title":"谢菲尔德大学与西南水务合作开发铅管识别机器学习工具"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f1b6QD_Lzm7c","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}